                        "form": "унифика́циях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f16dca3-d7b5-36cf-a1a3-0b9a2d325c91",
                        "entry_id": "b05d210b-ebed-3072-8706-378a1b6fb543",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. действие по значению гл. унифицировать; приведение к единообразию, к единому виду"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6310de9c-c6e3-4dff-b150-bf7e250ede53",
                                "sense_id": "6f16dca3-d7b5-36cf-a1a3-0b9a2d325c91",
                                "text": "Покупателю всё-таки хочется определённой индивидуальности, несмотря на унификацию моделей."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "02f8c35f-fded-454b-a33c-eb208e7fa2aa",
                        "source_entry_id": "b05d210b-ebed-3072-8706-378a1b6fb543",
                        "source_sense_id": "6f16dca3-d7b5-36cf-a1a3-0b9a2d325c91",
                        "target_lang_word": "unification",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unification",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e0b7160-b26d-3197-9afd-4bb6f72545d3",
                                        "entry_id": "03d217c9-0fb0-39b1-a240-a0b06e144df6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of unifying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e515c5e-3adf-4d0b-8eb7-b02697b20f65",
                                                "sense_id": "6e0b7160-b26d-3197-9afd-4bb6f72545d3",
                                                "text": "The route between Melbourne and Albury is one of the first scheduled, under the great Australian gauge unification scheme, for conversion to 4 ft. 8½ in., and this will permit through running between Melbourne, Sydney and Brisbane."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2758ab44-9f2d-4c79-981d-db019b61c703",
                                                "sense_id": "6e0b7160-b26d-3197-9afd-4bb6f72545d3",
                                                "text": "Despite criticisms which were made of the Railway Executive, it must be recalled that the general framework of the new railway set-up was established by statute, while this form of organisation was particularly well adapted for carrying out the unification of the railways—a very different thing from the purely political act of nationalisation, but an essential part of the objective of nationalisation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa62bd86-2dfa-3550-8578-ea2677b9617d",
                                        "entry_id": "03d217c9-0fb0-39b1-a240-a0b06e144df6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being unified."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdeb4fb9-7055-44c3-915f-61a8812d1c5c",
                                                "sense_id": "fa62bd86-2dfa-3550-8578-ea2677b9617d",
                                                "text": "Chinese domination in Manchuria was revived after the unification of China by the Sui Dynasty in A.D. 590, though this could not be called entirely complete because the Kaokouli kingdom could not be subjugated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1024a1a-bdde-4ce3-8235-dc3c60312f29",
                                                "sense_id": "fa62bd86-2dfa-3550-8578-ea2677b9617d",
                                                "text": "On November 15 our Ministry of Foreign Affairs informed Soviet ambassador Petrov of this decision. At the same time I sent a message to President Harry S. Truman, pointing out that Soviet Russia's treaty violations and bad faith in Manchuria not only were detrimental to China's territorial integrity and unification, but also constituted a serious threat to peace and order in East Asia, and that the only way to prevent any further deterioration of the situation would be for China and the United States to take positive and coordinated actions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd60087f-1ff6-4de9-884e-04bd987790d1",
                                                "sense_id": "fa62bd86-2dfa-3550-8578-ea2677b9617d",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, I must think of Korea and, particularly, of the three million enslaved Koreans in the North. My obligation as a leader of the Korean people is to achieve unification of our country by peaceful means if possible but by force if necessary."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "771599f1-b86c-3c9a-a4e5-04818e7e44ee",
                                        "entry_id": "03d217c9-0fb0-39b1-a240-a0b06e144df6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Given two terms, their join with respect to a specialisation order."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89283042-eb59-464d-8c40-e775a4ed1a0d",
                                                "sense_id": "771599f1-b86c-3c9a-a4e5-04818e7e44ee",
                                                "text": "5.7.T ( Unification theorem ) For any two terms or formulas\n without quantifiers X and Y, the following holds.\n(i) The unification algorithm UNIF₁, applied to X, Y,\n terminates after a finite number of steps.\n(ii) {X, Y} is unifiable iff UNIF₁ so indicates upon ter-\n mination. Moreover, the substitution σ then available as out-\n put is a most general unifier of {X, Y}."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
